$var wire 8 + result [7:0] $end
$var wire 2 , alu_op [1:0] $end
$var wire 1 - overflow $end
$upscope $end
$scope module memory $end
$var wire 16 . addr [15:0] $end
$var wire 8 / wdata [7:0] $end
$var wire 8 0 rdata [7:0] $end
$var wire 1 1 we $end
$var wire 1 2 re $end
$upscope $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
